            "detailed_description": "Pixel Star embodies arcade philosophy; brutally challenging, fun and rewarding. With a focus on progressively intense fast-paced action, player freedom, and solid gameplay, Pixel Star reimagines the shoot-em-up genre. From black holes to space centipedes, nebula storms to stray satellites, there is always something new to discover.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Loads of power-ups and customization options<br></li><li> Unique, varied enemy AI<br></li><li> Merciless boss battles<br></li><li> Progressive difficulty and intensity<br></li><li> Open-space environment<br></li><li> Gorgeous particle effects</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Pixel Star embodies arcade philosophy; brutally challenging, fun and rewarding. With a focus on progressively intense fast-paced action, player freedom, and solid gameplay, Pixel Star reimagines the shoot-em-up genre. From black holes to space centipedes, nebula storms to stray satellites, there is always something new to discover.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Loads of power-ups and customization options<br></li><li> Unique, varied enemy AI<br></li><li> Merciless boss battles<br></li><li> Progressive difficulty and intensity<br></li><li> Open-space environment<br></li><li> Gorgeous particle effects</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Endless arcade action takes a modern twist, creating a uniquely challenging open space shoot-em-up experience. From brutal bosses to black holes and beyond, countless hazards await discovery. How long can you survive?",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês",
